counterfactuals.output:
A method comprising:

storing frame image data corresponding to a plurality of image frames;

integrating the stored frame image data over a selectively variable number of image frames to generate integrated image data;

receiving power delivery network (PDN) state information; and

processing the PDN state information and the integrated image data to generate (i) a power-control signal and (ii) a window-size adjustment signal, the window-size adjustment signal being configured to modify the number of image frames over which the frame image data is integrated.
